{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e8e94daa4dfb18642f4f6b686f43887aaee720d8beff08f3b58c617f3ce2b52f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b84f534d6ac23514d95e26145432544c2a91214a68b97aeb7d8770429fbf03af",
      "text": "啊？你是谁啊，混账！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:232d95bb6c1d85594620ccb7b1386d58f343bc437c4b0704151a980b206a7a2b",
      "text": "俺是谁都无所谓吧？对企图对姑娘们动粗的\n家伙，俺可没名字好报的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8476397b7bed1a44d00b35c27806e59c3e684cb5f560539688e41e4b9c942f14",
      "text": "都说了，我是男生啦～～！\n呜呜，我看起来真有那么像女孩子吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36f9c4ef4744f93e54ba6fc6f72ee0baa642cd2f5250927d2a7830447c480d0b",
      "text": "这小鬼，挑了个好时候插手啊。\n你应该知道后果吧，喂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60684844f06fafa5112b0cfd1a1403e61642df3fd6b87e00fe0f823043b17b84",
      "text": "哎呀，真是群精神饱满的家伙。\n不过，做坏事可不行。嘿咻！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0c774460baa460e175c9a14c21b42bd0832622c190dfea6bedc42f40f65979f",
      "text": "哇啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:832d90323781f760bd48b7402c04e96b135894449a252fc1ef8b22072d073ecd",
      "text": "来，你们两个。趁现在快跑！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:184b107d1a71f7e56d23c2957ba72666d64d6fd91b9e943f5638a9793558dc70",
      "text": "谢谢、非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64eb4ac47ab21abe1b3e8cf04842c465aec5756a4cb5e47b8c3655b42d7edb19",
      "text": "那边的姑娘也……等等，嗯？\n你该不会是……秋月凉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78457266e2672b7963fac1102461c75a55f6582ce6a848a44ef8ce8c4b6ab3a5",
      "text": "可恶啊～～竟敢对我们动手！\n别以为能就这么算了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99dc8bc6f5d429ab25429ed0aa8b90b7b30dea5d93c3ddbaabe8087aac70c525",
      "text": "哎呀，说话等会儿再说。一起逃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a62c3ca4473b2f7c99b690b03b78c1ff97494287604ab5aed89dcf47f04edd1b",
      "text": "诶？啊，等一下……！\n……嘎哦哦哦嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
